# Night Raid UI — React-Lua

При работе с `src/client/**` стек UI = **React-Lua**, канон:

`C:\Projects\Roblox\roblox-starter\.cursor\rules\ui-react.mdc`

## Must

- Function components + hooks; `React.createElement`
- Tokens: `src/client/ui/theme.luau`
- Sizes: `useLayout()` → `layout.px` / `text` / `gap` / `touch`
- Motion: Flipper hooks already in `src/client/ui/hooks/`
- Wire remotes/attributes in `GameRoot` (или core), не в чистых presentational components

## Must not

- New HUD via raw `Instance.new` ScreenGui trees
- Fusion / Roact
- Business logic inside chip/button components

## Copy patterns from

- This repo: `App.luau`, `GameRoot.luau`, `components/Button.luau`, `ResourceChip.luau`
- Starter: `C:\Projects\Roblox\roblox-starter\src\client\ui\`
